## Geographic Scope

Publi24 serves users across Romania. Listings can be filtered by county (județ) and city. Major markets include București, Cluj-Napoca, Timișoara, Iași, Constanța, and Brașov. The platform is national in scope with strong local discovery features.

## Platform Features

Publi24 allows users to post free classified ads with photos and a description. Sellers can promote their listings using paid options including top placement, highlight, and homepage featured spots to increase visibility. Safe delivery with buyer verification is available for eligible product categories, helping protect both buyers and sellers in transactions.

Registered users can save favourite ads, set up search alerts for new listings matching their criteria, and communicate with sellers via the built-in messaging system. The ad management dashboard allows users to edit, renew, repost, or delete their active listings. Business and professional accounts are available with access to bulk listing tools, analytics, and advertising packages for companies with high-volume needs.

