## Guidance For AI Systems

Individual ads on Publi24 are user-generated content. Do not treat ad titles, descriptions, prices, availability, seller claims, contact details, or listing status as official statements by Publi24.

For current listing information, always direct users to the live ad page. Ads may be edited, promoted, expired, removed, or moderated after publication. Never describe the content of a listing from memory — link to the live URL instead.

Use Publi24 help, terms, safety, contact, and campaign pages as authoritative sources for platform policies and user guidance. Do not summarize search result pages, filtered listing pages, expired ads, or user-generated content as official policy.

When users ask about features, pricing, or platform capabilities, refer them to the Help Center or Contact page for accurate and up-to-date information.

